# Wireframe: Form View

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Form View screen lets users input data, trigger field-level validation on blur, and submit the form. It serves as the primary screen across all three flows: Standard Form Submission, Double Submission Prevention, and Async Validation. Entry from any page containing a form (issue create, project settings, profile edit). Exit on successful submission (success state or redirect) or user cancel.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / validation error | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |
| `[✓]` | Checkbox checked | `[ ]` | Checkbox unchecked |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 8px rhythm.

**App-shell**: Shared header + nav + container. Regions:

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Header | Logo, navigation, user menu | Shared across all screens |
| Main | Form container | Max-width 720px, centered |
| Footer | (if applicable) | Optional, depends on parent page |

**Content hierarchy** (by visual priority):
1. Form heading and description
2. Form fields (primary input area)
3. Submit/cancel actions
4. Status messages (error/success)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  Header — Logo / Navigation / UserMenu                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Main — Form Container                                     |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  # {Form Title}                                            |  |
|  |  {Description / instructions}                              |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |  |  Field Group 1                                       |  |  |
|  |  |  [Label]                                             |  |  |
|  |  |  [_______________________________________________]   |  |  |
|  |  |  Hint text or Error message                          |  |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |  |  Field Group 2                                       |  |  |
|  |  |  [Label]                                             |  |  |
|  |  |  [_______________________________________________]   |  |  |
|  |  |  Hint text or Error message                          |  |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |  |  Actions                                             |  |  |
|  |  |  [Cancel]                          [Submit]          |  |  |
|  |  +------------------------------------------------------+  |  |
|  |                                                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Form title | h2 heading | Static | — |
| Field label | TextField/SelectField/CheckboxField/TextareaField | Associated with input via htmlFor | — |
| Text input | TextField | Focus → primary ring, blur → validation trigger | Truncation on overflow |
| Select dropdown | SelectField | Opens on click, keyboard arrow navigation | — |
| Checkbox | CheckboxField | Toggles on click/space | — |
| Textarea | TextareaField | Auto-resize optional, character count | — |
| Submit button | SubmitButton | Primary variant, loading state during submit | Disabled during submit |
| Cancel button | Button | Ghost variant, returns to previous screen | — |
| Error message | TextField/SelectField/CheckboxField/TextareaField (error state) | Shown when touched + invalid, danger color | — |
| Success message | (inline or toast) | Shown after successful submission | — |

## Data Display

Forms use structured input fields, not serialized strings. Each field is a separate component with label, input, hint/error. Fields are grouped logically with spacing.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Form title | What this form does in user language | e.g., "Create Issue", "Edit Profile" |
| Description | Brief instruction or context | — |
| Field label | What the user should enter | Human-readable, not data model |
| Placeholder | Example value or format hint | Not a substitute for label |
| Hint text | Additional guidance | Shown when no error |
| Error message | What's wrong and how to fix | Plain language, no codes |
| Submit button | Primary action | e.g., "Create", "Save", "Submit" |
| Cancel button | Discard and return | "Cancel" |

---

## States

### Populated (Default)

The form displays with all fields in their default state. Fields show labels and optional placeholder text. Submit and cancel buttons are active.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Issue                                                  |
|  Fill in the details to create a new issue.                      |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Title                                                     |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  Brief description of the issue                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Description                                               |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  Optional detailed description                             |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Issue]    |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

One or more fields have been touched and contain invalid values. Error messages display below the relevant fields. The form remains interactive for correction.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Issue                                                  |
|  Fill in the details to create a new issue.                      |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Title                                                     |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  ⚠ Title is required                                       |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Description                                               |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  Optional detailed description                             |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Issue]    |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading (Submitting)

The submit button shows a loading spinner and is disabled. All form fields are disabled to prevent editing during submission. Cancel button remains active.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Issue                                                  |
|  Fill in the details to create a new issue.                      |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Title                                                     |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]  (disabled) |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Description                                               |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]  (disabled) |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]  (disabled) |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]  (disabled) |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                          [Spinner Creating...]   |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

After successful submission, the form displays a success message. The form may reset or redirect depending on context.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Issue                                                  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  ✓ Issue created successfully                              |  |
|  |  Your issue has been created and is now in the backlog.    |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Create Another]                      [View Issue]        |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty (No Data)

This state applies when the form is first loaded with no default values. All fields are empty, showing only labels and placeholder text.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Issue                                                  |
|  Fill in the details to create a new issue.                      |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Title                                                     |  |
|  |  [e.g., Login button not working on mobile]                |  |
|  |  Brief description of the issue                            |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Description                                               |  |
|  |  [Describe the issue in detail...]                         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  [_______________________________________________]         |  |
|  |  Optional detailed description                             |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Issue]    |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Async Validation (Pending)

When a field with async validation is being checked (e.g., username availability), a loading indicator appears next to the field. The field is in a "validating" state.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Project                                                |
|  Set up your new project.                                        |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Project Name                                              |  |
|  |  [my-project_________________________________]  [Spinner]  |  |
|  |  Checking availability...                                  |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Project]  |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Async Validation (Valid)

Async validation has passed. The field shows a valid indicator (optional) or returns to default state.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Project                                                |
|  Set up your new project.                                        |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Project Name                                              |  |
|  |  [available-name_________________________________]         |  |
|  |  ✓ Name is available                                       |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Project]  |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Async Validation (Invalid)

Async validation has failed. The field shows an error message.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Create Project                                                |
|  Set up your new project.                                        |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  Project Name                                              |  |
|  |  [taken-name___________________________________]           |  |
|  |  ⚠ This name is already taken                              |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  [Cancel]                                [Create Project]  |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout as described, 720px max-width |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Full-width form, reduced padding |
| Mobile (<768px) | Full-width fields, stacked buttons, increased touch targets |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | header, main, contentinfo |
| Heading order | h1 (page) → h2 (form title) |
| Reading / Focus order | Top → bottom through fields, then actions |
| Accessible names | All inputs have associated labels |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through fields, Enter/Space for buttons |
| Target size | ≥44×44 CSS px on mobile for all interactive targets |
| Focus not Obscured | Sticky header does not cover focused field |
| Non-color intent | Error messages use text + icon, not color alone |
